# BEST_PRACTICES.md - coding standards for <PROJECT_NAME>

> The single body of criteria for this repository. Agents write to it,
> reviewers judge against it, and a finding that cannot be traced to a rule
> here (or to `FAILURE_PATTERNS.md`) is an opinion, which is allowed to lose to
> a proven better answer.

